        "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to Chicken with Robot Legs! </strong><br>You are a chicken that wakes up in an unknown place. Not knowing who you are or why are you there you know one thing, you gotta get out of there!<br>Explore a 2D pixel world with a lot of secrets and collectibles, the chicken doesn't stop moving forward, you'll need to use your abilities and environment to traverse and find a way out. <br><br><strong>Features </strong><br>- the first game that combines the Runner and the Metroidvania genres a &quot;Runner-Vania&quot; game.<br>- explore alternate paths to uncover secrets and collectibles.<br>- upgrade the chicken with abilities that help you reach for new places.<br>- never stop running, use the scenery and abilities in neat ways to get your way around.<br>- collect various kinds of items to get rewards or open secret paths. ",
